Return data with cursor

```tsx
      return {
        posts: data.map((post) => {
          return {
            ...post,
            // more data
          };
        }),
        nextPageCursor,
      };
```

---

Call query and insert cursor as input

```tsx
api.post.inifiniteFeed.useInfiniteQuery(
    {},
    {
      getNextPageParam: (lastPage) => lastPage.nextPageCursor ?? undefined,
    },
  );
  ```
  
